    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d345">

                <pb facs="0773" n="659" sameAs="frus:frus1943/pg659"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">740.0011 Pacific War/3428</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Foreign Minister</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Soong</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1943-08-18">August 18,
                        1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: …<anchor n="1"
                        xml:id="d345-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>I also enclose for your information a memorandum on our assignments of Canadian
                    munitions. While it may not be as detailed as my verbal discussion with
                        you,<anchor n="2" xml:id="d345-f2"/> it is an outline which includes the
                    essential points.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tse Vun Soong</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d345-a1.xml" xpointer="d345-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
